[{"title":"嵩阳宫三将军柏","author":"黄克晦","text":"人间柏大此全稀，老干宁论四十围。\n盖偃曾倾天子葆，露寒应覆侍臣衣。\n犹看连影容千骑，那识何枝系六飞。\n惆怅茂陵无限树，荒丘残陇草菲菲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4866,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画三首 其一","author":"黄克晦","text":"江树何霏微，遥山苍翠里。\n秋风吹裳衣，人影桥下水。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4867,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画三首 其二","author":"黄克晦","text":"欲溯大江流，泊舟杨柳岸。\n潮上柳风吹，渡江天未旦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4868,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画三首 其三","author":"黄克晦","text":"江草引行路，水风吹渡桥。\n故人家咫尺，门外是春潮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4869,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送翁武举出塞赴陈中丞幕","author":"黄克晦","text":"欲系单于颈，长绳铁缕丝。\n出塞人应笑，入关世始知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4870,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"狼山归道中作","author":"黄克晦","text":"前山无夕阳，犹问夕阳洞。\n天寒人不行，山僧出相送。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4871,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"樵歌贻卢子明","author":"黄克晦","text":"采薪入深林，唱歌出幽谷。\n樵歌非无辞，辞古不可读。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4872,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太平水阁写画","author":"黄克晦","text":"远影乱归帆，孤烟发残磬。\n垂纶岸岸移，杨柳递相映。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4873,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"后出塞送陈季立防秋","author":"黄克晦","text":"朔风边月蓟门秋，画角呜呜百尺楼。\n自著戎衣频上策，三年不起别家愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4874,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出塞行四首送郭建初归戚都护幕中 其一","author":"黄克晦","text":"锁甲摇华铁戟寒，韬弓插羽上雕鞍。\n班超自有封侯骨，世业宁论是史官。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4875,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出塞行四首送郭建初归戚都护幕中 其二","author":"黄克晦","text":"风拂胡沙雪作尘，楼头吹角月华新。\n夜分莫作还乡梦，塞上悲歌半越人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4876,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出塞行四首送郭建初归戚都护幕中 其三","author":"黄克晦","text":"当时都护静倭奴，将校功高锦绕躯。\n今日军中思一战，年年马市款单于。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4877,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出塞行四首送郭建初归戚都护幕中 其四","author":"黄克晦","text":"蓟门白日塞烟开，记室翩翩草檄才。\n卫霍空教尊贵甚，当年投笔有谁来？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4878,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"少年行 其一","author":"黄克晦","text":"调笑胡姬夜不归，日高春酒不停挥。\n下楼忽听中山猎，白马烟中一点飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4879,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"少年行 其二","author":"黄克晦","text":"渡头相送一沾衣，日暮相思不下帏。\n潮水莫言还有信，渡船两日一回归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4880,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"少年行 其三","author":"黄克晦","text":"苦竹渡边苦竹枝，常思岭下常思谁。\n奴自不言谁得会，江风江雨自应知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4881,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"少年行 其四","author":"黄克晦","text":"云起南台墨未浓，俄然一雨暗千峰。\n篙师解说当年事，台下分明有白龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4882,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"康州图","author":"黄克晦","text":"乱山无径不通樵，渔舍阴阴映绿蕉。\n树杪泥干江水落，村边沙白瘴烟消。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4883,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江行有怀社中诸友","author":"康从理","text":"扁舟投落日，遥夜楚江隅。\n月上寒潮静，灯依野岸孤。\n驱驰悲断雁，牢落愧栖乌。\n一洒并州泪，东流入旧都。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4884,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岁暮泛彭蠡","author":"康从理","text":"旷望极平川，遥心自黯然。\n空烟疑有地，远浪不分天。\n暮色孤帆外，寒声落雁边。\n年催长路客，归思倍堪怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4885,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中哭朱海峰","author":"康从理","text":"旅食悲妻子，孤装执挽行。\n诺曾然夙昔，心岂隔幽明。\n角傍寒城语，涛兼夜雨声。\n间关千里道，君见死生情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4886,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观音阁","author":"康从理","text":"古寺夕阳边，凭虚思渺然。\n江声犹楚恨，山色自吴年。\n宿鸟回清磬，孤舟逗野烟。\n长廊灯影寂，徐步礼金仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4887,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再至京口有怀金焦旧游","author":"康从理","text":"层城舒远目，迢递送归鸿。\n岁月更新历，江山忆旧踪。\n钟声春浪静，灯影暮流空。\n愧有东林约，无因问远公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4888,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"曲池草堂和韵为项思尧赋","author":"康从理","text":"地临沧海胜，门向谢山偏。\n养晦非亡世，销年祇尚玄。\n松寒延月早，花艳得春先。\n且谩论高卧，知君在吕虔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4889,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄河夜泊","author":"康从理","text":"燕云朔雪路千重，飞藿关河岁暮踪。\n日落帆樯随雁骛，夜寒衾枕傍鱼龙。\n乡书寂寞天涯泪，客鬓萧骚镜里容。\n断岸蒹葭风雨急，一灯孤影听疏钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4890,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴门逢吴孝甫","author":"康从理","text":"握手天涯问钓矶，别情归思两依依。\n年华共老芙蓉剑，生事孤怜薜荔衣。\n雁外清砧侵坐急，霜边残叶傍愁飞。\n十年歧路怀君意，一入青山会转稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4891,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西津别妓","author":"邬佐卿","text":"立马江皋问暮潮，片帆西上路迢迢。\n人将碧草新晴去，魂对青山暮雨销。\n云色自依桃叶渡，月明凄断凤凰箫。\n楼头浊酒春堪醉，还访秦淮旧板桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4892,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词","author":"邬佐卿","text":"复道传呼御辈过，遥闻仙乐动云和。\n黄金纵买《长门赋》，逝水终惭太液波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4893,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"艳曲","author":"邬佐卿","text":"碧树映红楼，佳人是莫愁。\n竹枝看引凤，花色笑牵牛。\n舞罢月初落，歌残云欲流。\n何妨十日酒，醉杀秣陵秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4894,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辽西歌","author":"茅榛","text":"裨将分屯三十营，营营火炮震天鸣。\n纵教胡马如征雁，不敢衔芦过北平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4895,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汪司马东巡歌","author":"茅榛","text":"晓渡滹沱雪满河，辕门鼙鼓杂《铙歌》。\n为传今日新司马，原是南征旧伏波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4896,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观海","author":"叶之芳","text":"海碧何冥冥，空光连太清。\n白云飞不过，红日落还生。\n去鸟难分影，遥山安可名。\n何当借鳌背，载我向东行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4897,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入新安溪","author":"叶之芳","text":"可怪新安水，舟从石上行。\n不风秋暮冷，无月夜深明。\n古本何年偃，危湍几处惊。\n千寻犹见底，曾数越江清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4898,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿景光父","author":"叶之芳","text":"白露下疏牖，萧条秋夜凉。\n入门君未寝，明月在藜床。\n贫贱元同病，飘零只独伤。\n不堪闻蟋蟀，久已怨离乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4899,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别楚生二首 其一","author":"叶之芳","text":"同君楚水别，独向晋陵归。\n秋叶霜中尽，寒帆海上稀。\n城荒衰草遍，山远夕阳微。\n最是添愁处，天边一雁飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4900,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别楚生二首 其二","author":"叶之芳","text":"归人南国去，乡路入江烟。\n远树低山郭，寒潮没渚田。\n长风飘薄暮，短日傍残年。\n萧索难为别，惟应故旧怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4901,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春送别卷为韩八题（韩，蜀人，自楚还蜀中）","author":"叶之芳","text":"河梁日暮罢离尊，送尔西游去故园。\n湘渚月明春饮马，巴江花落夜猿闻。\n青山易堕天涯泪，芳草空销远客魂。\n何事不归长寄食，路旁谁更惜王孙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4902,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李汝学还上党","author":"顾圣少","text":"倾盖同为客，携樽复送君。\n悲凉谁作赋，南北此离群。\n坂没羊肠雪，山横熊耳云。\n相思岂无雁，可待九秋闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4903,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿佩上人房","author":"莫叔明","text":"支公不相马，夜向窗前闲。\n酿酒醉佳客，烧灯对灵山。\n庖厨竹树下，巾舄桃花间。\n一宿又何意，题诗重愁颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4904,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送秦马平表弟入京","author":"莫叔明","text":"翩翩白马只横行，杨柳秋风去客程。\n仗剑好言甥似舅，开樽莫为弟辞兄。\n檐藏绿屿衣边暗，树隐苍峰肘后明。\n闻道阳春唱高曲，大都不是别离声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4905,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"季冬章少参见访不值","author":"莫叔明","text":"欲知何事不逢君，闲向青山与鹤群。\n安得玉缸香是酒，但看青案字成文。\n天寒竹叶翻重翠，岁晚松枝起片云。\n户牖阿谁嫌寂寞，自然人语绝相闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4906,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别","author":"莫叔明","text":"年少辞家不畏劳，山间绿树戍楼高。\n桃花不合浑如泪，和雨纷纷上客袍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4907,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"会稽狱中访徐文长","author":"朱邦宪","text":"廿载神交意气同，相逢有泪洒阴风。\n箯舆拟作五经笥，圜室今为一亩宫。\n狱吏未能书牍背，侠徒那得载车中。\n天王何日封三府，不使沉冤射白虹？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4908,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荆轲","author":"朱邦宪","text":"匕首无功壮士丑，函封可惜将军首。\n秦庭一死谢田光，社稷何曾计存否。\n不知秦王环柱时，舞阳在前何所为。\n当时太子不早遣，待客俱来应未知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4909,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒夜集家兄园居有怀唐光禄三丈","author":"朱邦宪","text":"骑马冲寒共出城，一尊宵宴惬欢情。\n棋声到树鸟不定，池影入窗人倒行。\n林满清霜山更瘦，地留残雪月逾明。\n天涯忽忆离群客，长乐闻钟梦未成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4910,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"张左虞燕京惠诗却寄 其一","author":"朱邦宪","text":"迅风激高云，朔雁正南翔。\n良友在长安，寄我诗数行。\n恍闻渐离筑，忽洒燕山霜。\n肝胆两相照，然诺安能忘。\n结辔尔优游，块处吾傍徨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4911,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"张左虞燕京惠诗却寄 其二","author":"朱邦宪","text":"久挟三千牍，不共侏儒囊。\n空射箭头书，无益聊城亡。\n嗟嗟竟白头，蓬蒿泪沾裳。\n丈夫抱远略，策名在疆场。\n不知汉天子，曾复问冯唐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4912,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题","author":"朱正初","text":"长干车马少年同，此夕翻疑似梦中。\n杨柳有声吹作笛，梅花无数落随风。\n春山尚斗颦间翠，夜月都消枕上红。\n惆怅当时歌舞处，夕阳犹照小桥东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4913,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送友人北游","author":"潘纬","text":"樽酒慰行轩，交深敢赠言。\n经过郑庄驿，好问孟尝门。\n一诺休轻许，千金未是恩。\n年来长送客，此意不曾论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4914,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"简方际明","author":"潘纬","text":"昨暮登楼处，雨收溪上村。\n此时见新涨，直到君家门。\n旧岸集渔网，高斋藏钓纶。\n嘉鱼坐可办，好约同开樽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4915,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏月过佘松泉先生溪园","author":"潘纬","text":"花榭竹为垣，幽阴坐处繁。\n遥疑原上日，不到水边村。\n山雨带云集，松涛清昼翻。\n往来三径里，何地有嚣烦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4916,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄题方山人陵阳别业","author":"潘纬","text":"方干有旧业，本在青溪东。\n近卜陵阳隐，因怀庞德风。\n百年耕陇上，八口寄庵中。\n独羡渔樵侣，能将出处同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4917,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬夜奉怀从兄汝和时在江西","author":"潘纬","text":"予行江水北，君行江水西。\n两乡千里隔，一梦几回迷。\n雨雪连天远，梅花落月低。\n所思何处在，残夜听鸣鸡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4918,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答方佥宪定之先生","author":"潘纬","text":"时违长弃置，身贱寡交亲。\n方学渔樵业，甘为农圃邻。\n坐愁坐白发，出畏染缁尘。\n十载攻词赋，无媒只旧贫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4919,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得双佩剑送方生趋幕府","author":"潘纬","text":"延津双玉虹，神物合雌雄。\n易用千金购，难为一割功。\n尘埋余斗气，岁远结阴风。\n感激封侯去，龙鸣出匣中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4920,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日忆山中书隐","author":"潘纬","text":"及兹农事候，令予归不闲。\n本无西畴耕，为趁东风还。\n旧庐在林莽，树石繁其间。\n时春方雨余，好鸟声关关。\n门柳媚柔条，萝径滋苔斑。\n涧鸣始流泉，座对初青山。\n寓目但成景，偃仰多欢颜。\n此乡能似否，宁不思回醾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4921,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过蒋南泠翁大参休园喜鸿胪诸昆载酒留集","author":"潘纬","text":"蒋生风雅存，异代馥兰荪。\n修竹仍三径，垂杨自一村。\n啼莺呼过客，幽草映闲门。\n旧识求羊侣，重怜载酒樽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4922,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邗江逢欧桢伯学博余昨过广陵以夜半渡关失访后移官偶遇赋赠","author":"潘纬","text":"广陵关外路，夜半梦中过。\n骑鹤人逢晚，听鸡客误多。\n去来同雨雪，吏隐各烟波。\n携得新诗别，相思日日歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4923,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"官庄春暝","author":"潘纬","text":"一径掩蒿蓬，孤村烟霭中。\n鸣蛙出水曲，宿鸟隐花丛。\n高树留残照，遥山映暮空。\n无人伴幽兴，招月听丝桐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4924,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日官庄","author":"潘纬","text":"幽居近喜卜东溪，远市依依隔水西。\n堤柳渐迷来客驾，山花自发野人蹊。\n游鱼晴戏陂塘暖，雊雉朝飞垄麦齐。\n更好林莺听不尽，双柑斗酒日劳携。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4925,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"官庄晚霁","author":"潘纬","text":"平原眺晚霁，百里见苍山。\n鸟带浮云去，人从暮霭还。\n村童过雨集，野老到秋闲。\n倚杖逍遥者，听蝉竹径间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4926,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中赠友人","author":"潘纬","text":"西园独偃息，伏枕连朝昏。\n送客偶出户，看云还倚门。\n田芜没平野，木落见前村。\n怜尔幽怀者，时来相与论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4927,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日溪堂","author":"潘纬","text":"村居无广厦，松竹自成阴。\n长日林中卧，风枝落布衾。\n时怜野渔唱，复爱幽蝉吟。\n孤酌还乘兴，临流理素琴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4928,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿白岳社山中","author":"潘纬","text":"白社负幽期，青山寄空宅。\n偶携林中友，重卧岩下石。\n云归忽闭关，月出更留客。\n不着尘梦还，潺湲响终夕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4929,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送徐汝抟还三衢","author":"潘纬","text":"怜君遽为别，风色敝裘寒。\n郭外关河远，樽前岁腊残。\n人归姑蔑国，帆过子陵滩。\n夹岸梅花发，相思好奈看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4930,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"銮江秋暮","author":"潘纬","text":"家远信音稀，怀归未得归。\n途穷剑空在，性懒念多违。\n旅馆午寒闭，江城秋雪飞。\n还惭京兆客，何事泣牛衣？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4931,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过方别驾市上园","author":"潘纬","text":"久为弦歌出，仍无三径资。\n还山种松菊，傍舍葺园池。\n门闭喧能隔，庭闲鸟亦知。\n一樽时自醉，犹笑弃官迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4932,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蚕妇吟","author":"潘纬","text":"采桑复采桑，无嗟为蚕饥。\n食君筐中叶，还君机上丝。\n还君丝，织君绮。\n贫女养蚕不得着，惜尔抽丝为人死。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4933,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初夏同王应凤佘日章汪以仁以敬过佘子玉园居","author":"潘纬","text":"背市园居寂，到门芳草深。\n呼童出贳酒，留客坐鸣琴。\n鸟作辞春语，松生入夏阴。\n求羊无夙约，开径自相寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4934,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上渡","author":"潘纬","text":"渡头风雨急，桥断夜来水。\n时有唤舟人，招招者谁子。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4935,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"松石台","author":"潘纬","text":"倚松踞磐石，无伴坐亦好。\n不信石无尘，松风与洒扫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":4936,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]